{"change_summary":"No additional carbonate, save-path, or snapshot source changes were required in this apply-fixes pass. The current workspace already matched the approved explicit carbonate-equilibrium rollout, so this stage focused on verification; after a local `cargo fmt --all` normalization, the tracked worktree returned clean and the full `tank_core`, `tank_data`, and `tank_scenarios` validation suite passed.","outstanding_risks":["`solve_carbonate_equilibrium()` still uses the freshwater-focused approximation with fixed `Ka2`, so any extension beyond the intended pH 5.5-8.5 aquarium envelope should revisit the chemistry model.","Legacy saves with custom out-of-range source-water catalog entries still deserialize, but runtime water-change actions against those profiles fail validation until the profile is corrected.","The unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory remains in the worktree and was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the latest approved carbonate-equilibrium state and the current workspace for any unresolved follow-up fixes or conflicting tracked deltas.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply any remaining carbonate follow-up edits; skipped because the workspace already contained the approved implementation and no new actionable review amendments remained.","order":1,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Normalize formatting locally and rerun workspace validation to confirm the approved implementation remains green in the current checkout.","order":2,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo fmt --all --check` passed after normalization.","`cargo test -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios` passed across the full tank_core, tank_data, and tank_scenarios suites.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.","`git status --short` after validation showed no tracked source deltas; only the unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory remains."]}